{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Ropes"}],"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:5Ropes4RopeV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Rope","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Rope"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"Rope","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Ropes\/Rope.swift#L26","fileName":"Rope.swift"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A rope: a sequence stored as a balanced tree of chunks, so inserting, removing or replacing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements anywhere costs O(log "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") plus the elements moved within one chunk, rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") an array spends shifting everything after the edit."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/SK","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sl","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SQ","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s25ExpressibleByArrayLiteralP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SH","doc:\/\/Ropes\/SM","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sk","doc:\/\/Ropes\/Sm","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Ropes\/ST"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Operators","title":"Operators","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\/Ropes\/Rope\/+(_:_:)"],"generated":true},{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ropes\/documentation\